---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
const updated = "2026-07-11";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Use | Valhouette Scribe"
  description="Terms of Use for Valhouette Scribe. Governs use of this website and its content."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container container--content">
      <header class="page-header">
        <p class="page-eyebrow">Guidelines</p>
        <h1 class="page-title">Terms of Use</h1>
        <p class="page-updated">Last updated: {updated}</p>
        <hr class="page-rule" />
      </header>

      <div class="legal-body">
        <h2>Using this website</h2>

        <p>By using Valhouette Scribe, you agree to these Terms of Use.</p>

        <h2>Intellectual property</h2>

        <p>
          Every essay, quiz, image, illustration, and piece of writing published
          on Valhouette Scribe is original work unless stated otherwise.
        </p>

        <p>
          You're welcome to quote short passages with proper attribution. If
          you'd like to reproduce or license any material, please get in touch
          first.
        </p>

        <h2>Website use</h2>

        <p>
          You're welcome to read, share links to, and reference this website for
          personal and educational purposes.
        </p>

        <p>
          You may not reproduce the content, scrape the website, harvest its
          material, mirror it elsewhere, or use it to train artificial
          intelligence models without written permission.
        </p>

        <p>
          Please don't attempt to interfere with the operation or security of
          the site.
        </p>

        <h2>Quizzes</h2>

        <p>
          The quizzes are reflective tools designed to encourage observation
          rather than diagnosis.
        </p>

        <p>
          They are not medical, psychological, or clinical assessments and
          should not be treated as professional advice.
        </p>

        <p>
          Every quiz runs entirely inside your browser, and no answers or
          results are stored by Valhouette Scribe.
        </p>

        <h2>No warranties</h2>

        <p>
          The content on this website is provided for reflection, education, and
          general information. While every effort is made to ensure accuracy, no
          guarantee is made that every essay or resource will be complete,
          current, or suitable for every individual.
        </p>
        <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
        <p>
          To the fullest extent permitted by law, Valhouette Scribe shall not be
          liable for any indirect, incidental, consequential, special, or
          punitive damages arising from your use of this site or any content
          accessed through it, even if advised of the possibility of such
          damages.
        </p>

        <h2>External links</h2>
        <p>
          This site may contain links to external websites. These links are
          provided for convenience only. Valhouette Scribe does not endorse,
          control, or take responsibility for the content, practices, or
          policies of any external site. Your use of any external site is
          subject to that site's own terms.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes</h2>

        <p>
          These terms may occasionally be updated as the website grows. The
          latest revision date will always appear at the top of this page.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>

        <p>
          If you have questions about these terms, you can contact Valhouette
          Scribe at
          <a href="mailto:contact@valhouettescribe.com">
            contact@valhouettescribe.com
          </a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-header {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }
  .page-eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .page-title {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .page-updated {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .page-rule {
    border: none;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    margin-top: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
  .legal-body h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2vw, 1.4rem);
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
  }
  .legal-body p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.85;
    color: var(--body);
  }
  .legal-body a {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-hover);
    padding-bottom: 1px;
  }
  .legal-body a:hover {
    border-bottom-color: var(--accent-warm);
    color: var(--heading);
  }
</style>
